{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2160,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Recently some friends of mine went to the Gordon Dam in Tasmania,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5540,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is 126.5 meters (or 415 feet) high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10780,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then they dropped a basketball over the edge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14820,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see that the basketball gets pushed around a bit by the breeze,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18280,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it lands basically right below where it was dropped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21660,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now watch what happens when they drop another basketball,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24080,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this time with a bit of backspin..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27420,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Woah,  look at that go!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31280,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"That's incredible.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37820,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"This is Bret who just threw it.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40260,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I litterally just dropped it, with a bit of spin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43120,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like I didn't even throw it, and it just took off, like we had no idea that was gonna do that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48480,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is where I come in:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50160,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the basketball was subject to the Magnus effect,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52500,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which affects all rotating balls or cylinders as they fly through the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56360,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it works like this:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57440,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the basketball picks up speed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59520,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "air on the front side of the ball is going in the same direction as its spin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63580,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore it gets dragged along with the ball and deflected back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67560,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Air on the other side is moving opposite to the ball spin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70500,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the flow separates from the ball instead of getting deflected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74080,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The net result is the ball pushes air one way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76780,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the air applies an equal force on the ball the other way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80720,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is known as the Magnus effect,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82800,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "named after Heinrich Gustav Magnus who described it in 1852."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87420,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, Isaac Newton beat him to it by nearly two hundred years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90680,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "describing the flight of tennis balls at Cambridge College."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93640,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, you know, he's got enough stuff named after him...."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96660,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This effect is very important in sports like tennis, soccer and golf,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101100,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but could it have non-sport applications?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104060,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perhaps."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104980,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a sailboat. I know it doesn't look like a sailboat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108400,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but those aren't chimneys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109860,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are spinning cylinders called \"Flettner rotors\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112860,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they take the place of the sails."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115460,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They deflect crosswinds, using the Magnus effect, to propel the ship forwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120300,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is a plane with spinning cylinders instead of wings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124620,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Using the Magnus effect, the cylinders actually generate more lift than traditional wings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129440,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However they also generate way more drag, making them impractical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133740,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This place only flew once, and then it crashed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137480,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the Magnus effect is making a comeback."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139380,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is an experimental rotor wing aircraft which generates all its lift from spinning cylinders."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145040,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is the E-Ship 1 which uses four spinning cylinders (that's four Flettner rotors)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150660,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to increase its efficiency and reduce the amount of diesel it burns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155080,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, in the future, the Magnus effect may help more than just basketballs fly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160200,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Woah, look at that go!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165180,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the real reason my friends from \"How Ridiculous\" were at the dam"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168200,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was to set the world record for the highest basket ever scored."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172000,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So go check out their channel and the video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174260,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and subscribe to them for more epic trickshots."
    } ]
  } ]
}
